      "text": "Trade-offs:\n• one read per message, no pause/nack\n• precision ≈ one tick\n  (WHEEL_RESOLUTION_MS)\n• memory grows with ALL in-flight\n  messages, not bounded\n• nothing committed until delivered:\n  rebalance or crash replays the\n  whole in-flight set as duplicates\n• scales vertically, not horizontally",
      "originalText": "Trade-offs:\n• one read per message, no pause/nack\n• precision ≈ one tick\n  (WHEEL_RESOLUTION_MS)\n• memory grows with ALL in-flight\n  messages, not bounded\n• nothing committed until delivered:\n  rebalance or crash replays the\n  whole in-flight set as duplicates\n• scales vertically, not horizontally",
